      "section": "How to use the parts lists and diagrams",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.00192000000001,
        "t": 304.5916,
        "r": 536.2119100000001,
        "b": 257.00160000000005
      },
      "content": "The figures in this chapter show the major sub-assemblies in the printer and their component parts. A parts list table follows each exploded view assembly diagram. The table lists the item number, the associated part number, and the description of each part. If a part is not listed in the table, then it is not a field replacement unit (FRU).",
